ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nXuanxuan, Zhiming, and Weijie are college classmates. That day, they go to a party together. Zhiming jokes that his dance skills are sure to beat Weijie. Then, Zhiming notices Xuanxuan standing alone in the corner, not dancing. He quickly walks over and calls out in a special voice: \"Weijie, watch me dance the steps you teach me yesterday.\" Then Zhiming starts to dance. Zhiming dances very happily, but he occasionally glances at Xuanxuan's reaction. Xuanxuan sees Zhiming loudly calling Weijie and his dancing, and she seems less restrained.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Zhiming loudly call Weijie to watch him dance?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Zhiming just learns new dance steps and wants to show off to Weijie.\nB. Zhiming is joking and wants to amuse Weijie.\nC. Zhiming wants to compete with Weijie in dancing.\nD. Zhiming loudly calls Weijie to attract Xuanxuan's attention.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0028007996261320786,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e20fd6006945d2801513","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368015407,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:33:35","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"ab51bcf416e540159e5a510e18b8d46f"}